    },
    {
      "number": 50,
      "text": "فَبِاَىِّ حَدِيۡثٍۢ بَعۡدَهٗ يُؤۡمِنُوۡنَ\u0026rlm; ",
      "translationNo": "Her kommer norsk oversettelse",
